{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788217691478,"sessionID":"ses_fa5eba7fdffec2uHvZPcMB5MvE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9d845953b492a56b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"gh issue view 168"},"output":"title:\tImplement --explain-offload compiler diagnostic\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t168\n--\nRuled in the multiplicity-and-offload-round2 grilling round (question vectorizability-visibility): silent, cardinality-derived vectorizability is confirmed, discoverable via an opt-in --explain-offload build flag that annotates compiled output with which sub-expressions became vectorized kernels and which fell back, and why. No type-system or signature change. Editor/LSP hover is a wanted future addition, deliberately unscheduled.\n","metadata":{"output":"title:\tImplement --explain-offload compiler diagnostic\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t168\n--\nRuled in the multiplicity-and-offload-round2 grilling round (question vectorizability-visibility): silent, cardinality-derived vectorizability is confirmed, discoverable via an opt-in --explain-offload build flag that annotates compiled output with which sub-expressions became vectorized kernels and which fell back, and why. No type-system or signature change. Editor/LSP hover is a wanted future addition, deliberately unscheduled.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"gh issue view 168","time":{"start":1788217691473,"end":1788217691477}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me start by reading AGENTS.md and getting the issue context.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"