udly, never skips.\n    fmt            # Formatter check over every .toy file from the repo root down (exit 1 on drift).\n    fmt-write      # Rewrite drifted files in place (same exit code as the check).\n    peek           # Watch the current coordinator tick live (detaches with Ctrl-C, tick untouched).\n    slow-test      # this is where the deferred execution claim is re-verified.\n    test           # The final gate: the full test suite. Landing requires this green.\n    tick           # Fire one coordinator tick right now (zero tokens if there is nothing to do).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"just --list","time":{"start":1788217695756,"end":1788217695757}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me read the issue comments. The issue says 0 comments. Let me look at the repo structure and AGENTS.md (already in context). Let me explore the codebase.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05a149d71001Py3Q1tDVkEJ7iJ","sessionID":"ses_fa5eba7fdffec2uHvZPcMB5MvE","messageID":"msg_05a149633001TjN299Bq4Ldf6n"}}
